source: crates/plasm-agent-core/src/mcp_server.rs
expression: "super::mcp_server_initialize_instructions()"
---
Plasm MCP tools (in order): **`plasm_context`** (session + teaching TSV), **`plasm`** (dry-run plan), **`plasm_run`** (live execute), **`discover_capabilities`** (when **`api`/`entity`** unknown).
     **One goal → one stable **`intent`** → one **`plasm_context`**.** `logical_session_ref` (`s0`, …) is per goal, not per API. Multi-API: one **`seeds`** array (see **`plasm_context`** tool).
     **`discover_capabilities`**: one **`intent`** per goal. **Default response is fenced `tsv`** (`api` / `entity` / `description`) — do **not** pass **`typed`** unless the TSV ambiguity note requires structured disambiguation. Merge rows into **`plasm_context`** **`seeds`**; retry with a narrower `intent` if entities are missing.
     **`plasm_context`**: **`intent`** + **`seeds`**; returns **`logical_session_ref`** + teaching TSV. **Steady state:** reuse ref with **`plasm`** / **`plasm_run`**; do not repeat identical **`seeds`**.
**JSON `program` string:** Prefer `\n` between bindings, then bare comma-separated roots. Single-line space-separated bindings are **supported** (not preferred); coercion rewrites a **trailing** root to the **first** binding when it differs (`metadata.coerced_default_return` may be set). Decoded strings need real newlines for heredocs.

**Heredoc:** After `<<TAG`, body on next line; close with trimmed `TAG` (or `TAG)` / `TAG,` / `TAG}`). Use a long opaque `TAG` not in the body.

Symbols: `e#` entity, `m#` method, `p#` field/filter/param, **`r#` relation nav**, `v#` value-domain. Relation fanout: copy `.r#` or wire from exemplars — not bare `p#` after `.` on a receiver. Homograph: `labels = issues.p#` forgiven only when binding name matches relation wire; prefer exemplar `.r#`/wire. Grammar: **`plasm_context` teaching TSV** preamble (`page`/`wait`/`cancel`/`pcN` in contract + tail).
     **`plasm`** is **plan-only** (no live HTTP). Prefer **one** `program` per call (comma-separated roots on the final line for multi-return). Multi-root answers: review with **`plasm`**, execute with **`plasm_run`**. Never prefix roots with `return`.
     **`plasm_run`**: same args as **`plasm`**; live HTTP after plan review. May return run snapshot URIs.
     **Paging:** **`page(l_<token>_pgN)`** / `_meta.plasm.paging` in the same logical session.
     **Long ops:** **`+`/`~`/`=`** open — **`wait(h)`** on **`plasm_run`** until **`!`**/**`x`** or **`cancel(h)`**; no unrelated live runs or user “done”. Parallel OK — poll each 3–5s.
     **Snapshots:** `plasm://…` → **`resources/read`** when Markdown points there.
